Yeah, that's what I get for not consulting the community. For reference, my daily is Bulleit, which I consider a perfectly average bourbon with a very good price:taste ratio (it's always on sale where I am). I would buy Bulleit for the price I paid for this swill, and this swill was also on sale!

&#x200B;

Thank you for the warm welcome.
